<title>INDONESIA: Bakrie plans 3-for-1 bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Bakrie plans 3-for-1 bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian conglomerate Bakrie &amp; Brothers said on Thursday it plans to issue bonus shares in the ratio of three shares for each one currently held.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that shareholders would be asked to approve the proposal at an extraordinary general meeting on November 8, but gave no more details.</p>
</text>
